msgid "Internationalizing plugins"
msgstr "国际化插件"

msgid ""
"In the same way :ref:`doc_internationalizing_games` works, you can create "
"translations for editor plugins. Everything that applies to games also "
"applies to plugins, but the process of enabling translations for plugins is "
"slightly different."
msgstr ""
"与 :ref:`doc_internationalizing_games` 的操作方式相同，您也可以为编辑器插件创"
"建翻译。所有适用于游戏的设置同样适用于插件，但为插件启用翻译的流程略有不同。"

msgid ""
"After generating your CSV or POT file and creating translations, you cannot "
"simply load the translations in the project settings; instead, you must go "
"through the :ref:`class_TranslationServer` to add a "
"new :ref:`class_TranslationDomain`."
msgstr ""
"在生成 CSV 或 POT 文件并创建翻译后，您无法直接将这些翻译加载到项目设置中；相"
"反，您必须按照 :ref:`class_TranslationServer` 手动添加一个新"
"的 :ref:`class_TranslationDomain` 。"

msgid ""
"The above code will load all available translations for your plugin, "
"assuming the translations are located in the ``addons/my_plugin/locale`` "
"directory. You should also choose a unique translation domain name to avoid "
"collisions with other domains; using your plugin's path as the domain name "
"ensures this."
msgstr ""
"上述代码将加载您插件中所有可用的翻译文件（假设这些翻译文件位于 ``addons/"
"my_plugin/locale`` 目录下）。您还应选择一个唯一的翻译域名，以避免与其它域名发"
"生冲突；将您的插件路径作为域名即可确保这一点。"

msgid ""
"If we consider the dock from :ref:`doc_making_plugins_custom_dock`, you now "
"need to tell the dock to use this translation domain:"
msgstr ""
"若需使用来自 :ref:`doc_making_plugins_custom_dock` 的 Dock，您现在需要告知该 "
"Dock 使用此翻译域："

msgid ""
"The last thing you need to do is remove the translation domain when the "
"plugin is disabled:"
msgstr "在禁用该插件时，最后一步操作是移除翻译域："

msgid ""
"With all of this done, you can change the editor's language to check your "
"translations."
msgstr "完成上述操作后，您可以更改编辑器的语言设置，以检查您的翻译结果。"

msgid ""
"You will need to disable and re-enable your plugin once, as it needs to "
"call :ref:`_enter_tree() <class_Node_private_method__enter_tree>` in order "
"to load translations."
msgstr ""
"您需要将该插件禁用并重新启用一次，因为该插件需调用 :ref:`_enter_tree() "
"<class_Node_private_method__enter_tree>` 才能加载翻译内容。"
